  "subTitleDesc": null,
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "台灣寺廟文物調查",
    "sub_ename": "INVESTIGATING TAIWAN'S TEMPLE TREASURES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以臺灣宗教文物為主，試圖結合宗教文物的「知識背景」與文物所在空間得寺廟「實地考察」，讓學生熟悉並瞭解台灣寺廟文物類型、工藝價值、應用場合、歷史源流及其宗教文化之意義。",
    "describe_eh": "This course delves into the rich world of religious artifacts in Taiwan, seamlessly integrating theoretical knowledge with hands-on exploration of the temples where these artifacts reside. Through this immersive approach, students will gain a comprehensive understanding of the diverse types of religious artifacts found in Taiwanese temples, their artistic and craftsmanship values, their contextual usage, historical origins, and their profound religious and cultural significance.",
